    "quote": "Manufacturers must report any battery-related fire, thermal runaway, or event requiring emergency-service response to the market regulator within 24 hours of becoming aware of it, with a fuller incident report within 10 business days. Other confirmed thermal incidents must be reported to the regulator within 5 business days."
